The planned LemonVN project is free and open source under Apache-2.0 for the
corresponding code. Its present personal/non-commercial operating goal adds no
commercial-use restriction to that license. Separate component and service
terms still apply; the current internal test candidate is not release clearance.

The public source snapshot excludes inherited signing material, legacy game
data/artwork/fonts and old publishing workflows, while retaining the client
source and tests. The original development repository/history is preserved.
The upstream LICENSE retains historical attribution for translation data;
that legacy data is not included in the LemonVN source snapshot.
